Subject: [PATCH] Format contextual header validation and label regression
 failures

Review correction: Format contextual header validation and label regression failures.

This isolated V2 candidate change preserves the existing Bitcoin parser and
mainnet parameters. Module tests do not establish lotusd block acceptance.
---
